    "html": "<section class=\"lu-claro\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;color:#151515;--rosa:#C8661F;--paper:#151515;--muted:#8A8580;--soft:#4A4744;--g1:#F4F1EC;--line:#E7E2DB\"><style>.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card-r,.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pill-r{background:#FFC48F}.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}</style><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');</style><p class=\"abs a pm-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;--d:0\">Guion 16 de 19 · Lifestyle + humor</p><div class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:128px;top:166px;padding:4px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#3E6FA8;color:#151515;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:0\">Atraer</div><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:300px;top:168px;width:1100px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;--d:0\">Serie: Expectativa vs. realidad · Objetivo: <b>Envíos</b></p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:128px;top:212px;width:1380px;font-size:36px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;--d:1\">Texto: «Expectativa: entrenar teniendo hijos»</p><div class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:128px;top:330px;width:1400px;--d:2\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.35;color:#151515\"><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:8%\">Tiempo</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:27%\">Qué se ve</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:40%\">Qué dices</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:25%\">Texto en pantalla</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#F7F3EE;\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">0-4 s</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#4A4744\">Expectativa: entreno perfecto, luz bonita, música tranquila.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;font-weight:600\">—</td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#4A4744\">Expectativa: entrenar teniendo hijos</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">4-9 s</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#4A4744\">Corte seco a la realidad: niño encima, esterilla ocupada, juguetes.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;font-weight:600\">—</td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#4A4744\">Realidad</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">Serie</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#4A4744\">Mismo formato con: organizar un viaje, ir a hacer kite e intentar grabar contenido.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;font-weight:600\">—</td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#4A4744\">Misma música y mismo texto en todos</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:1592px;top:128px;width:200px;height:356px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:#ddd url(https://levelup.luciaentrenadorapersonal.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/me-considero-una-persona-scaled.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(21,31,48,.18);--d:1\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(21,31,48,0) 45%,rgba(21,31,48,.45) 100%)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:20px;right:20px;top:206px;text-align:center;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;text-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fff\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.85\">Expectativa vs. realidad</div><div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;margin-top:6px\">Expectativa vs. realidad</div></div></div><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:1592px;top:492px;width:200px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;--d:1\">Portada</p><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:128px;top:842px;width:800px;padding:18px 24px;border-radius:16px;background:#FFC48F;--d:4\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3A2F2F\">Cierre (CTA)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;color:#151515\">Texto: «¿Cuál hago la próxima?»</span></div><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:960px;top:842px;width:832px;padding:18px 24px;border-radius:16px;background:#F7F3EE;--d:5\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F\">Descripción</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:#3A3836\">Expectativa vs. realidad de entrenar teniendo hijos. Entrenadora y madre.</span></div><div class=\"foot\" style=\"left:128px;\"><span>Maen Studios × Level Up Workout</span><span class=\"n\">19</span></div></section>"
