    "id": "estetica",
    "titulo": "Colores y tipografía",
    "html": "<section class=\"lu-claro\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;color:#151515;--rosa:#C8661F;--paper:#151515;--muted:#8A8580;--soft:#4A4744;--g1:#F4F1EC;--line:#E7E2DB\"><style>.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card-r,.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pill-r{background:#FFC48F}.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}</style><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');</style><p class=\"abs a pm-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;--d:0\">Identidad · Estética</p><h2 class=\"abs a disp\" style=\"left:128px;top:176px;width:1664px;font-size:56px;line-height:1.05;--d:1\">Tres colores y una tipografía</h2><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:128px;top:300px;width:272px;height:300px;border-radius:24px;background:#151F30;border:1px solid #E7E2DB;--d:0\"></div><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:154px;top:500px;width:230px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;color:#fff;--d:1\">Azul noche</p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:154px;top:542px;width:230px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:#fff;opacity:.8;letter-spacing:.06em;--d:1\">#151F30</p><p class=\"abs a soft\" style=\"left:132px;top:620px;width:264px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;--d:2\">Texto y fondos sin foto. Es el azul de tu web.</p><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:428px;top:300px;width:272px;height:300px;border-radius:24px;background:#FFCB9A;border:1px solid #E7E2DB;--d:1\"></div><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:454px;top:500px;width:230px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;color:#151F30;--d:2\">Melocotón</p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:454px;top:542px;width:230px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:#151F30;opacity:.8;letter-spacing:.06em;--d:2\">#FFCB9A</p><p class=\"abs a soft\" style=\"left:432px;top:620px;width:264px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;--d:3\">Solo para destacar: una palabra, un detalle.</p><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:728px;top:300px;width:272px;height:300px;border-radius:24px;background:#F7F3EE;border:1px solid #E7E2DB;--d:2\"></div><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:754px;top:500px;width:230px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;color:#151F30;--d:3\">Blanco roto</p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:754px;top:542px;width:230px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:#151F30;opacity:.8;letter-spacing:.06em;--d:3\">#F7F3EE</p><p class=\"abs a soft\" style=\"left:732px;top:620px;width:264px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;--d:4\">Texto sobre fotos y fondos limpios.</p><div class=\"abs pm-card pop\" style=\"left:1060px;top:300px;width:732px;height:460px;--d:2\"></div><p class=\"abs a rosa\" style=\"left:1100px;top:334px;width:660px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:3\">Tipografía única</p><p class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:1100px;top:376px;width:660px;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:96px;line-height:1;color:#151F30;--d:3\">Poppins</p><p class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:1100px;top:500px;width:660px;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.5;color:#151F30;--d:4\"><b style=\"font-weight:700\">Bold</b> para títulos de portada<br><span style=\"font-weight:600\">Semibold</span> para subtítulos<br><span style=\"font-weight:500\">Medium</span> para la etiqueta de la serie</p><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:1100px;top:660px;width:660px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;--d:4\">Es la misma de tu web, así Instagram y Level Up se ven como una sola marca. Gratuita (Google Fonts).</p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:128px;top:860px;width:1664px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;--d:6\">Fuera: contornos de colores, azules eléctricos, tipografías condensadas y mayúsculas en todo. Menos elementos, más reconocible.</p><div class=\"foot\" style=\"left:128px;\"><span>Maen Studios × Level Up Workout</span><span class=\"n\">28</span></div></section>"
